WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Use the post as a prototype. Use publishing signals to choose the next product test.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Publish one clear hypothesis.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Listen for the audience’s language.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Record demand and contradiction.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Change one product assumption.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Let evidence choose the next test.
